# Stable spec ID: iba-corpse-reviver-2. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(gin) 30 ml
(orange liqueur @ Cointreau) 30 ml
(aperitif wine @ Lillet Blanc) 30 ml
(lemon: juice, fresh) 30 ml
(absinthe) 1 dash

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(cocktail glass)

::instructions
<shake, all measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<strain, into a chilled (cocktail glass)>
<garnish, with orange zest>

